  "title": "Qt: Keep the I/O Graph legend in order",
  "description": "Unlike other QCustomPlot elements, adding something to a QCPLegend\nthat is already there doesn't move it to the bottom. So to keep\neverything in sync, clear it and start over when we update.\n\nAlso make sure to update the legend when moving items up and down.\n\nRelated to #13855",
